1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:03,850
She was fastened by a light chain
to one of the seats on deck,

2
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:06,220
and was moving restlessly
and whining

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,700
in a little plaintive pipe
like a bird's.

4
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,750
Every time I passed by her,

5
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:13,320
she stretched out her little,
black, cold hand,

6
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:17,000
and peeped up at me out of her
little mournful, almost human eyes.
